Copyright (c) Softwyx

This license applies only to files that originate from the Softwyx SPT Mod Template
("Template Files"), including copies and modifications of those files. It does not
apply to code you write yourself in a project started from this template.

## Template Files

Template Files are the files shipped in this repository under `template/` and the
shared tooling at the repository root (`scripts/`, `New-SptMod.ps1`, root `LICENSE`,
`TEMPLATE-ATTRIBUTION.md`, `.editorconfig`, `.gitattributes`, `qodana.yaml`, and
similar scaffolding). If you are unsure whether a file is a Template File, treat
files you did not author from scratch as Template Files unless you replaced them
entirely.

## Your project

You may license your own new files and your mod as a whole under any terms you
choose. You are not required to ship this LICENSE with your mod or paste it into
player releases.

## What you must do

Keep TEMPLATE-ATTRIBUTION.md in your repository and mention in your README that
the project was created using the Softwyx SPT Mod Template (see that file for
wording). Include TEMPLATE-ATTRIBUTION.md in release archives and in the BepInEx
plugin folder when you distribute builds.

## Template Files — permissions

You may use, modify, and redistribute Template Files as part of your mod subject to:

1. The attribution rules in TEMPLATE-ATTRIBUTION.md.
2. This license continuing to apply to those Template Files and your modifications
   to them.

